night sky illuminated by CARAT lightsticks, it captures the essence of SEVENTEEN’s record-breaking nine-year legacy. Relive the exhilaration of the concert in ScreenX, 4DX, and ULTRA 4DX for an unparalleled experience.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2024-08-14","status":"Released","rating":8.8,"ratingCount":4,"genres":["Documentario","Musica"],"countries":["South Korea"],"facts":{"Runtime":"103m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1897256,"name":"S.COUPS","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jqsvpqMSupL8X5l4M4LwgKwvaVB.jpg"},{"id":1897257,"name":"JEONGHAN","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dHvM7PEwMwL3D3ifpClCdVJLZZa.jpg"},{"id":1897258,"name":"JOSHUA","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cbEjrSGrHAXB57xgrtc2XxiSP3C.jpg"},{"id":1625880,"name":"JUN","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z1seXrQQWG7nsQVHqSWKefJQ8DO.jpg"},{"id":1897260,"name":"HOSHI","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/akbHG1hegEwzA8eqth83wtpH1KR.jpg"},{"id":1897259,"name":"WONWOO","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t7tJvKJ8CLwFik4HqVbiYkcIJdX.jpg"},{"id":1897261,"name":"WOOZI","role":"Self"},{"id":1897264,"name":"THE 8","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMg7XU6R2zrWIPVY66PuWVTfM7M.jpg"},{"id":1897265,"name":"MINGYU","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aI40rxtCUFnHDxGTYJtEKrEPXKB.jpg"},{"id":1897263,"name":"DK","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3TxlEtoM93TNl9Md9lk8OcJFHXC.jpg"},{"id":1897266,"name":"SEUNGKWAN","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kYa2ffG2V0SwJJTQt5A29bWSqQc.jpg"},{"id":1897267,"name":"VERNON","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3O6jWDX2EZDx9nuGmpOvCAcHfMr.jpg"},{"id":1897268,"name":"DINO","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2s1A8fHNvt3NUKIvBoGxc36sFEe.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Seventeen Tour 'Follow' Again to Cinemas"},{"language":"en-US","title":"SEVENTEEN TOUR 'FOLLOW' AGAIN TO CINEMAS","overview":"Rewriting history every step of their way, SEVENTEEN’s first Seoul World Cup Stadium concert and encore tour [SEVENTEEN TOUR ‘FOLLOW’ AGAIN TO SEOUL] is coming to big screens worldwide this August! From the eagerly awaited full thirteen-member performances to the premiere of “MAESTRO” and unique unit performances of “Spell”, “LALALI”, “Cheers to youth”, the film captures these unforgettable moments with cinematic cameras from multiple angles, ensuring an immersive experience. This concert film begins with a powerful daylight performance that transitions into an event brimming with a diverse array of music. Culminating under a night sky illuminated by CARAT lightsticks, it captures the essence of SEVENTEEN’s record-breaking nine-year legacy. Relive the exhilaration of the concert in ScreenX, 4DX, and ULTRA 4DX for an unparalleled experience."},{"language":"ko-KR","overview":"매 순간 새로운 역사를 쓰고 있는 세븐틴의 첫 서울월드컵경기장 입성의 가슴 벅찬 순간, 초대형 스타디움에서 펼쳐진 세븐틴 앙코르 투어 [SEVENTEEN TOUR ‘FOLLOW’ AGAIN TO SEOUL]이 8월, 스크린으로 펼쳐진다! 전 세계가 기다린 13인 완전체가 선사하는 공연, ‘MAESTRO’ 퍼포먼스 최초 공개 현장의 폭발적인 열기와 ‘청춘찬가', ‘Spell’, ‘LALALI’ 등 세 유닛의 개성 가득한 무대까지, 잊을 수 없는 그날의 순간들을 시네마틱 카메라를 총동원해 다양한 앵글로 담아낸다. 일광을 배경 삼아 펼쳐진 강렬한 오프닝부터, 밤하늘을 캐럿봉으로 빛내며 이어진 다채로운 음악과 퍼포먼스, 9년의 대기록을 증명하며 스타디움을 가득 메운 관객과 뜨겁게 교감한 그날의 전율을 ScreenX, 4DX, ULTRA 4DX로 더 크게, 더 생생하게 느껴보자."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjqo5fkdz5eDGnPasc78RRiOKVM.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjqo5fkdz5eDGnPasc78RRiOKVM.png","language":"en","width":851,"height":411}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zvVQw8dGxDuOvrq858uMHxCC851.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zvVQw8dGxDuOvrq858uMHxCC851.jpg","language":"en","width":200